<title>HONG KONG: Yip's Pota  shares debut at HK$1.30 each.</title>
<headline>Yip's Pota  shares debut at HK$1.30 each.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of souvenir maker Yip's Pota International Co Ltd made their trading debut at HK$1.30 per share, compared with their issue price of HK$1.00 per share.</p>
</text>
